1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - learned together with his younger brother Max in local school and later in university - Death of brother Max in 1911 in War of Caucasus staggered the merry and social Erik - he fell in blues. - Thanks to the care
2 CONC  of relatives Erik slowly recovered. There was a lot of merit also to maid of her sister Renata - lovely and sincere girl. Erik and maid fell in love. But as Erik announced to his parents about a wish to marry simple maid, his mot
2 CONC her decided to exclude such possibility. She decided to disgrace the girl so that she leaves the manor. Eleonora organised departure of Erik and made a false letter from Erik informing poor maid that Erik is leaving to marry anoth
2 CONC er girl of his estate. - Mother of Erik did not know that maid was pregnant. Maid could not survive the disgrace and hung herself. - This tragedy made Erik mad and he shoot himself in the park of palace in 1912. - There are told s
2 CONC tories that spirit of unhappy maid appears in the palace in full moon nights.
2 CONT
2 CONT a. Idsel
2 CONT
