1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Viktor died Wiesbaden 16.11.1988, He was a Dr.jur, Oberstleutnant, a psychotherapist and a RechtsRitter of the JohannitterOrden.  He married in Osnabrück 21.6/Gretesch, Germany 22.6.1942 Maina Schoeller, * Gretesch
2 CONC  3.2.1922, + Wiesbaden 11.10.2002, landscape photographer, daughter of factory owner Lothar Schoeller and his wife Helene Montag. They had 5 surviving children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Victor A l e x a n d e r Felix Walter, * Berlin 26.7.1942, + St. Zacharie, Dept Var, France, 18.7.2013, teacher and nature healer. He married in Bad Soden, Taunus, Germany, 5.3.1976 Elzbieta Trzyblska, * Rzeszów, Poland, 27.9.1
2 CONC 946, employee of the Hessian Broadcasting Service, (divorced Frankfurt, Germany 10.12.1980), daughter of Zbigniew T and Danuta Hubczenko.
2 CONT Alexander subsequently formed a de-facto relationship with Brigitte Therenet, * Cusset, Dept Allier, France, 7.12.1955 and had 3 sons by her (who do not inherit nobility because they were born out of wedlock):
2 CONT (a) Mikhael (*) Gap, Dépt Hautes-Alpes, 16.12.1987, Hotelmanager;
2 CONT (b) Jeremy-Aurel Mathieu (*) Aix-en-Provence, Dépt Bouches-de-Rhône, 16.2.1998;
2 CONT (c) Alexander (*) Saint Zacharie, Dépt Var, 23.1.2000.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Günter, * and + in 1943
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Ekkehard Hans, * * Bad Rothenfelde, Teutoburger Wald, Germany, 21.3.1946, + Öhningen am Bodensee, Germany, 7.5.2022, owner of manor Stutengarten in the district of Radolfzell, Dr. med, owner of critical care medical facility fo
2 CONC r psychosomatic care, a portrait photographer and a Knight of grace of the JohanniterOrden; married Pappenheim in Middle Franconia, Germany, on 6.2.1976 Nicotine Gräfin von der Recke von Vollmerstein, * Weissenburg, Middle Francon
2 CONC ia, 29.6.1953,  Agricultural Engineering graduate, daughter of Dr of agr. Gert Graf von der Recke von Vollmerstein and agricultural graduate Ursula Gräfin zu Pappenheim, owner of the Pappenheim estate. They have 3 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Leon-Testa Gabriel Amaro, * São Paulo, Brazil, 21.5.1976, Dr. med, manager of of hospital; married is Basthorst, in the district of the duchy of Lauenburg (Schleswig Holstein), 23.6.2012 Maximiliane (Milana) Freiin von Ruffin, 
2 CONC * Hamburg, Germany, 31.1.1985, business adviser, daughter of landowner Enzo Freiherr von Ruffin, owner of the estate of Basthorst, and singer and entertainer Vassiliki (Vicky) Papathanasiou (stage name 'Vicky Leandros'). There are
2 CONC  children of this marriage but they carry the name 'von Ruffin' and I don't yet have details. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b) Imogen Julia Florence, * Munich 29.5.1980, MA in art history, fashion designer, married (1)
2 CONT Hinterzarten, Hochswchwarzwald, Germany, 7.12.2002 Philip Hirzel, * Zürich 15.4.1962, + Zürich 21.11.2006, economist; 
2 CONT Hinterzarten, 13.9.2008 Hansjörg Schmitt, * Frankfurt am Main 8.10.1972, Banker. [I understand this marriage is also dissolved either thru divorce or death of the spouse but need to obtain and add details.]
2 CONT
2 CONT c) Anatol Nicolosch Conrad Valentin, * München 1.6.1981, may now be assisting with the management of his father's medical facility in Hinterzarten. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. M i c h a e l - Hubertus, Münster, Westfalen, Germany, 8.9.1949, banker and CEO of a child protection agency in Vietnam, + Saigon, Vietnam, ? 2021, married Frankfurt am Main 25.4.1973 Amei Weber, * Berlin 28.5.1942, Teacher, (d
2 CONC ivorced Frankfurt 28.1.1982) [Amei had a son, Sven, * Frankfurt 2.5.1963, from her previous marriage, whom Michael adopted and who bears the name 'von Brasch' as a result. He became a salesman and married in Frankfurt 2.5.2001 Mon
2 CONC ika Margareta Küpfer, * Buttenheim in Obberfranken 9.8.1962 and she is works a science project team leader. Michael subsequently married
2 CONT Frankfurt am Main 21.4 (religious wedding Alaminos in the Philippines) 16.5.1982 Zenaida Cortez y Ricosana, Pangasinam, Philippines, 16.7.1959, saleswoman, (divorced Frankfurt 31.3.2010), daughter of architect Candido C.y R. and M
2 CONC iguela Bengal. He has 2 children in Germany of this marriage. 
2 CONT a) Raphael Eduardo Victor, * Frankfurt 29.12.1982, IT expert; 
2 CONT b)Geraldine Alicia, * Frankfurt 21.3.1984, student...
2 CONT He subsequently formed a de facto relationship in Vietnam with Thi True Ngan Can, * Ben Are City, Mekong-Delta, Vietnam, 12.2.1982, fashion model, and has one child by this union:
2 CONT aa) Richie Tien Anh von Brasch (*) Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam, 5.5.2009 {won't be recognised in the family genealogy as noble because of birth outside of marriage)
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Marius Udo Eberhard, Cologne, Germany, 25.4.1958, PhD, Artist-painter, bookbinder, video-artist, lives in the UK.
2 CONT
2 CONT I can provide more information on the family and photos at another time  
2 CONT
2 CONT
