1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Obituary'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Baron Pierre von Prittwitz und Gaffron unexpectedly died in 6 January 2004.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre was born in Paris, France on 7th October, 1955. The son of Baron Alexis von Prittwitz und Gaffron and of his wife, Baroness Hélène von Prittwitz und Gaffron (née Countess Bobrinskaya), herself the daughter of Count Pierre B
2 CONC obrinsky and his wife, Princess Maria Trubetskaya. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1983, Pierre married Helena Dorothea Henniker, by whom he had three children.
