1 OCCU русский авиатор, одна из первых женщин-пилотов
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%94%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%83%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0,_%D0%A1%D0%BE%D1%84%D1%8C%D1%8F_%D0%90%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%B0 Софья Алексеевна Долгор
2 CONC укова] во втором браке княгиня Волконская (1887—1949) — русский авиатор, одна из первых женщин-пилотов.
2 CONT
2 CONT Единственная дочь от этого брака Софья Петровна Долгорукова — Скипвич (англ.;1907-1994), мать П. Л. Зиновьева, умерла в Англии.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=ERA.28.2.20325:118?216,830,993,490,0 Kodakondsus tunnistuse kontsud - 1920] +foto
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=ERA.28.2.20027:1?1514,1226,746,359,0 Toimik - 1920]
2 CONT *Abielu: https://www.ra.ee/dgs/browser.php?tid=68&iid=110700718214&img=era0028_002_0020026_00012_t.jpg&tbn=1&pgn=1&prc=50&ctr=0&dgr=0&lst=2&hash=50c945ca514c2d815aa9675e310f6c17
2 CONT *Maetud - https://old.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=114907516
2 CONT
2 CONT Sophy Bobrinsky, whose father was the Marshal of the Russian Nobility, president of the Union of the Nobility of the Russian Provinces, and a Knight of the Order of Saint Alexander Nevsky, studied medicine and became a respected s
2 CONC urgeon, learned to fly in 1913 and was one of the first female bomber pilots, was the only female participant in a motor rally from St. Petersburg to Kiev in 1912, and also published satirical poetry under a pseudonym. In 1916 she
2 CONC  returned from medical service in the Russian military with malaria and two St. George crosses, and after the October Revolution she re-entered Bolshevik Russia and secured the release of her second husband from prison, and subseq
2 CONC uently supported him in Paris by driving a taxi. She gave her daughter a diminutive of her name. 
